        — LEN     = 2 / 4 / 8 (length in feet)
        — WBUNDLE = WATTSELECT bundle code per length:
                    LV3P2: 2035 (~20-35W range · 14W min · 35W max)
                    LV3P4: 3550 (~35-50W range · datasheet wattage bundle code)
                    LV3P8: 4080 (~40-80W range · datasheet wattage bundle code)
